映入眼睑是一张清丽而陌生的小脸，本能地反应，霍地坐起，出手如风，狠狠掐上那姑娘洁白的脖子上：“你是谁！”“小…小姐……”那姑娘或许没想到媚儿会突然醒过来，吓得身子一抖，黑白分明的美眸里尽是惧意。“谁是小姐？你是谁？说！”媚儿眯起媚眼，手上的力道不自觉地加重的一分，紧盯着眼前的女子，像从她的脸上看出什么破绽来。“我…我是小仙……”那叫小仙的姑娘被她掐得两眼直冒金星。“小仙？”看出她并没有撒谎，媚儿慢慢地松开了手，开始打量着周围的环境，而这种陌生的感觉，让她心中不由咯噔了一下，眼神骤然一寒，喝问道：“说！这里是哪里？”她记得自己奉命去杀一个古董店的老板，而进了那个古董店之后，她随手拿了一块奇怪的玉佩看了看，结果两眼一花，接着就不省人事了。醒来这里陌生的一切，她的第一个反应就是自己着了别人的道！“这里是药王谷。”而那叫小仙的姑娘边答边揉着被她掐得生疼的脖子。“药王谷？”媚儿蹙紧眉头，药王谷是什么地方，她怎么从来都没有听说过，正欲问小仙药王谷是什么地方。“小仙，师父说把这个给小姐喂下……”门却被人打开了，一个长相清秀的男子走了进来，手上还端着个碗，也许是惊讶着媚儿已经醒来了，张开嘴剩下的话却没说出来。媚儿的反应一如刚才，迅速跃起，修长的玉指直掐住那男子脖子，将他直抵到门上：“告诉我，你们把我抓到这里来做什么？”声音如同抹上了一层寒霜。“小姐……”那男子或许没有想到媚儿会有这么好的身手，一时紧张，手上的碗啪地一声掉到了地上。“要我再重复一遍吗？”媚儿眸色加深，如刀般锋利的眼神直盯得男子发毛，手上的力道也不自觉地加了一分力道，满意地看到男子因憋气而涨红的脸。“小姐，您先松手……”媚儿狠戾的眼神，让男子觉得一股寒意从脚底直窜脑门。媚儿冷哼一声，将男子甩到了一旁：“快说！”她暗中运力，觉得身上并无不适，只要这一男一女敢耍花样，她不介意送他们一程！那男子边揉着被掐得生疼的脖子，边说着原因。媚儿越听，眉心锁得越紧，开什么国际玩笑，她居然从现代莫名地穿越到了古代。原来她血淋淋的一幕幕，并不是梦，而是她现在这个身体的主人伍辰儿所经历过的一切，因为伍辰儿死时怨气太重，而正是那些怨气将她硬拉回了这个古代！“伍辰儿！你放心，我媚儿既然占用了你的身体，就一定会去找那对狗男女替你报仇！”宝贝们，喜欢的话，别忘了加入收架哦，票票评价支持不能少哦～～小小的支持，二少给你们大大的惊喜～～", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The First Hatred of Genocide Meier felt a sharp pain in her chest. In a daze, she heard someone calling her Chen'er. She saw the bloody scenes, and she also felt the pain and hatred that penetrated deep into her bones! Her name is Meier, how could she be Chener? However, she could also relate to everything that happened to that woman, as if she had experienced it herself! Dream, yes! She must be dreaming! She felt someone playing with her face and body. She wanted to stop it, but her hands were too weak to lift up any strength. Slowly, she fell into the boundless darkness again! \"Uh!\" I don't know how long it took, but she finally woke up, and what came into her eyelids was a beautiful and unfamiliar little face. She reacted instinctively, sat up suddenly, took out her hands like the wind, and pinched the girl's white neck fiercely: \"Who are you!\" \"Little... Miss...\" The girl may not have expected that Mei'er would suddenly wake up, and she trembled with fright, her beautiful black and white eyes full of fear. \"Who is Miss? Who are you? Tell me!\" Mei'er narrowed her eyes, and unconsciously tightened her hand, staring at the woman in front of her, as if she could see some flaw in her face. \"I...I am Xiaoxian...\" The girl named Xiaoxian was pinched so hard that stars appeared in her eyes. \"Xiao Xian?\" Seeing that she was not lying, Mei'er slowly let go of her hand and began to look at the surrounding environment. This strange feeling made her heart skip a beat, her eyes suddenly turned cold, and she asked, \"Tell me! Where is this place?\" She remembered that she was ordered to kill the owner of an antique shop, and after entering the antique shop, she took a strange jade pendant and looked at it. As a result, her eyesight blurred, and then she fell unconscious. When she woke up to everything unfamiliar here, her first reaction was that she had fallen into someone else's trap! \"This is Yaowang Valley.\" The girl named Xiaoxian answered while rubbing her neck that was so painful from being pinched. \"Yao Wang Valley?\" Mei'er frowned. Where is Yao Wang Valley? Why has she never heard of it? She was about to ask the little fairy where Yao Wang Valley was. \"Xiaoxian, Master said to feed this to Miss...\" The door was opened, and a handsome man walked in, holding a bowl in his hand. Perhaps he was surprised that Meier had woken up, but he opened his mouth but did not say the rest of the words. Meier's reaction was the same as before, she jumped up quickly, strangled the man's neck with her long jade fingers, and pushed him against the door: \"Tell me, why did you catch me here?\" Her voice was like a layer of frost. \"Miss...\" The man probably didn't expect that Mei'er would have such good skills. He was so nervous that the bowl in his hand fell to the ground with a snap. \"Do you want me to repeat it again?\" Mei'er's eyes deepened, her eyes as sharp as knives stared straight at the man's hair, and she unconsciously increased the strength of her hand. She was satisfied to see the man's face flushed from holding in his breath. \"Miss, please let go first...\" Meier's fierce eyes made the man feel a chill running straight from the soles of his feet to his forehead. Meier snorted coldly and threw the man aside: \"Say it quickly!\" She secretly used her strength and felt that she didn't feel any discomfort. As long as this man and woman dared to play tricks, she wouldn't mind giving them a ride! The man was rubbing his sore neck while explaining the reason. The more Meier listened, the tighter her eyebrows were furrowed. What kind of international joke was she making? She had actually inexplicably traveled from modern times to ancient times. It turns out that her bloody scenes were not dreams, but everything that Wu Chen'er, the owner of her current body, had experienced, because Wu Chen'er had too much resentment when she died, and it was those resentments that dragged her back to this ancient time! \"Wu Chen'er! Don't worry, since I, Mei'er, have taken over your body, I will definitely go find that pair of bitches to avenge you!\" Darlings, if you like it, don't forget to join in to end the fight. You can't lack support through votes and comments~~ With this small support, the Second Young Master will give you a big surprise~~", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}